Cell["\<\
If you have a tensor network with:
Tensor A with indices {i, j, k}
Tensor B with indices {k, l, m}
Tensor C with indices {m, n}

The bonds would be:
{k, k} \[RightArrow] dimension of k (connects A and B)
{m, m} \[RightArrow] dimension of m (connects B and C)
While {i, j, l, n} would be free indices (appearing only once).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.977579296741395*^9},ExpressionUUID->"f6a80950-8079-4b94-99a8-\
9ed68f6334d8"],

