Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["RandomTensorNetwork[{n vertex,m edges}, max dimension, additional \
rank]",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\nGiven a random graph generated as RandomGraph[{n,m}] for specifying \
connectivity, then one can specify a max dimension and max rank. Note that \
vertex degree overwrites the max rank if the max rank is less than vertex \
degree"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.976052674402438*^9, 3.976052677622492*^9}, {
